# aggressor against its chosen sandbox_targets[] as national rivals at 65
# (Feud within reach of crisis injections); all actors list each other in
# scenario_enemies[] (declared scenario enemies, symmetric); the aggressor
# takes a war support grant. THIS is the aggressor; targets are read from
# the persistent sandbox_targets[] array via var: scope.
